    <briefingLines>
      <Value><![CDATA[PROJECT | ████ (it's a game. act surprised)
BUDGET | yes
DRESS CODE | Christmas jumper, worn without irony
DEADLINE | before the gløgg goes cold
SCOPE | fixed. ████ (it is not fixed)
CLIENT | ████ (difficult. possibly a horse)
EQUIPMENT | one phone, charged. yes, charged. we mean it
TEAM | everyone. also you. especially you
RISKS | the wifi, then the gløgg, in that order
METHOD | agile, in the sense that nobody knows what happens next
CAREER PATH | you will be knocked out. it counts as a promotion
DELIVERABLE | one real website, built live, with your face on it
HIDDEN ASSET | one almond. a real mandelgave. tell no one
SUCCESS CRITERIA | last one standing becomes Founder & CEO. no pressure]]></Value>
    </briefingLines>
    <ndaClauses>
      <Value><![CDATA[The undersigned (hereafter 'you') agrees that none of this happened, especially the parts that did.
You will not discuss The Project with colleagues, family, or any Jira board, open or closed.
All estimates given under the influence of gløgg are legally binding. Those are the rules.
If you find the almond, you will act surprised. Hiding it in your cheek voids this agreement.
Any pitch you submit becomes property of The Project. Including the bad ones. Especially those.
In the event of scope creep, you agree to say 'we'll look into it' and walk away slowly.
I agree not to tell the horses.]]></Value>
    </ndaClauses>
    <heckles>
      <Value><![CDATA[Does it work on IE?
My nephew could build this
Can you make the logo bigger?
Can you zoom in?
Why isn't it blue?
We had this in the old system
Can it be more... you know. More.
Can it export to Excel?
I thought this was included
Can we make it pop?
I showed it to my family. They have notes.
Quick one: can we change everything?
It looked different in the PowerPoint
Who approved this? Was it me?
Can we get it as an app?
Scroll up. No, down. No, up.
Is that test data or my actual email?
Can it also do AI?
It's just a button, how hard can it be?
I'll send my feedback as a Word document]]></Value>
    </heckles>
    <lobbyTips>
      <Value><![CDATA[Charge your phone. We will only say this 40 more times.
Take a selfie. It ends up on a real website. Smile nicely.
Type your own pitch. The worse it is, the better it does.
Getting knocked out is a promotion. You become Management.
There is one almond in the game, and a real mandelgave behind it.
Dialled in from home? Tonight you are a hologram. Enjoy the slippers.
The room code changes every 30 seconds. So do the requirements.
Pick a job title. It is the only promotion you will get before January.
Bugs look exactly like features. Just like in real life.
Tap an emote. The big screen sees everything.
No tilt controls. We know how long you have been at the julefrokost.
The game starts when the host flips the switch. Do not ask when.]]></Value>
    </lobbyTips>
    <deployLines>
      <Value><![CDATA[$ git push origin main --force
✓ {player} approved their own pull request
warn: {card} has no tests, shipping anyway
npm install: 4,812 packages, 3 of them are left-pad
Building {project}... this will only take a moment (it will not)
✓ Compiled {card} with 47 warnings. Nobody read them.
Running tests... 0 found. 0 failed. ✓
{player} is typing... {player} is typing... {player} has left the channel
Migrating database. Are you sure? (y/n) y y y y
✓ Moved {card} to Done without asking QA
error: {card} failed. Retrying with more confidence.
Restoring Umbraco backoffice... please do not publish anything
✓ Removed console.log('here') x 312
warn: {player} was last seen 'just quickly' fixing something in prod
Uploading selfies to {project}/team... nobody blinked. Almost.
✓ Lighthouse score for {project}: 100 (we closed our eyes)
Asking {player} if it is okay to deploy on a Friday... no answer. Deploying.
Clearing cache. Clearing the other cache. Finding a third cache.
✓ {card} shipped as designed. The design was a napkin.
DNS propagating... could take 48 hours or 4 seconds
warn: CARRIED OVER cards detected. Renaming to 'Coming Q3'.
Writing testimonials for {project}... the clients have notes.
✓ {player} added to the team page. Job title pending HR.
Compressing images: hero.png (48 MB) -> hero.png (47 MB)
Checking timesheets for {player}... 0 hours logged. As expected.
✓ Cookie banner now covers 100% of {project}
error: merge conflict in julefrokost.cs. Accepting both.
Deploying {card} to prod. Staging was 'basically the same'.
Warming up the server with gløgg...
✓ SSL certificate valid until the first working day of January
{player} pressed the big red button. It was decorative.
Rolling back... no, rolling forward. We only roll forward.
✓ {project} passes accessibility: the nisse can reach all the buttons
Notifying stakeholders... 14 out-of-office replies received
info: rubber duck consulted. The duck has concerns.
✓ Estimated: 2 hours. Actual: this entire party.
Adding snow effect to {project}. Removing snow effect. Client wants it back.
warn: scope of {project} grew 300% during this log line
✓ Hiding the almond in the footer
{project} is live. Do not touch anything.]]></Value>
